────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ■ Kit 

 What goes into this install?
 Space checks a part, Enter takes the list as it stands.

   Always
   [✔] Question relay     a session's questions reach your
                          phone
   [✔] Panel tools        checklist, briefs, a call to your
                          phone, restart
   Quiet — checked for you
 ❯ [✔] Page copies        a published page opens on the
                          phone under any account
   [✔] Context cap        stops a session at the cap,
                          restarts it with your line
   On request
   [ ] Docker cleanup     weekly prune of unused images — of
                          the whole machine
   Ways in besides this machine
   [ ] Tailscale          your phone from anywhere, through
                          your tailnet
   [ ] Home network, TLS  straight at home, with a
                          certificate you issue

 Space to toggle · Enter to accept · ↑/↓ to move · Esc to go
 back
